'''Xmas Gals''' (クリスマスギャルズ, ''Kurisumasu Gyaruzu'', '''Christmas Gals''') is a Seasonal Gacha Event that appears during the [[Santa Claws at Work!]] event. It features 8 new ubers: [[Santa Kuu (Uber Rare Cat)|Santa Kuu]], [[Frosty Kai (Uber Rare Cat)|Frosty Kai]], [[Holy Coppermine (Uber Rare Cat)|Holy Coppermine]], [[Yuletide Nurse (Uber Rare Cat)|Yuletide Nurse]], [[Snow Angel Twinstars (Uber Rare Cat)|Snow Angel Twinstars]], [[Keiji Claus (Uber Rare Cat)|Keiji Claus]], [[Reindeer Terun (Uber Rare Cat)|Reindeer Terun]] and [[Winter General Kaihime (Uber Rare Cat)|Winter General Kaihime]]. All of them are variants of preexisting Ubers ([[Kuu (Uber Rare Cat)|Kuu]], [[Kai (Uber Rare Cat)|Kai]], [[Coppermine (Uber Rare Cat)|Coppermine]], [[Nurse Cat (Uber Rare Cat)|Nurse Cat]], [[Twinstars (Uber Rare Cat)|Twinstars]], [[Maeda Keiji (Uber Rare Cat)|Maeda Keiji]], [[Terun (Uber Rare Cat)|Terun]] and [[Narita Kaihime (Uber Rare Cat)|Narita Kaihime]] respectively).

