==Trivia==
*Xmas Gals, [[June Bride (Gacha Event)|June Bride]] and [[White Day Capsules (Gacha Event)|White Day Capsules]] are the only seasonal Gacha Events without an exclusive [[Neneko (Super Rare Cat)|Neneko]].
**Interestingly, a Christmas themed Neneko did exist complete with [[True Form]] in [[Nyanko Defence Force]].
*Prior to [[Version 11.0 Update|Version 11.0]], the Xmas Gals was the only seasonal banner featuring only Uber Rare Cats.

